{
  "dom_id": "step-e5012",
  "name": "Example: Identifying Equal Vectors",
  "problem": "Find the pairs of equal vectors in the diagram shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14196310/assets/536069f862ae1044f9e924714ef3e2327c17b632a1b5da336ffac30f50fcf783.png)",
  "worked_solution": "Two vectors are equal if and only if they lie on parallel lines and have both the same magnitude and the same direction.\n\nThe vectors $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{e}$ are parallel and have the same direction and magnitude, hence $\\mathbf{a} = \\mathbf{e}.$ Similarly, $\\mathbf{b}$ and $\\mathbf{d}$ are parallel and have the same direction and magnitude, hence $\\mathbf{b} = \\mathbf{d}.$\n\nOn the other hand, $\\mathbf{a} \\neq \\mathbf{b}$, $\\mathbf{a} \\neq \\mathbf{c}$ and $\\mathbf{b} \\neq \\mathbf{c}$ because they are not parallel.\n\nTherefore, we get $\\mathbf{a}=\\mathbf{e}$ and $\\mathbf{b}=\\mathbf{d}$ only.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14196310/assets/03ef54909ccfcd9c8e1f85746ec5b981e6a88c1fbf1f0c6c2337b19b05c694a7.png)",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e5012\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Identifying Equal Vectors</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e5012\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <p>Find the pairs of equal vectors in the diagram shown below.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-ae48778d424182417df1283036b16013\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/ae48778d424182417df1283036b16013\"></div>\n                    </div>     \n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            directi